  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhance the fisheries and aquaculture policy framework in Sierra Leone</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthen the fisheries and aquaculture sector policy and regulatory framework through:

1. Establishment of the Competent Authority for Fish and fishery products at the MFMR and
2. Development of two draft policy frameworks for the relatively under-developed inland fisheries and aquaculture, an area with huge but untapped potential in Sierra Leone</narrative>
  </description>
